OL,3,AJudge denies motion to dismiss Lindsay
OL,4,AClancy's murder case
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Massachusetts judge has denied a
OL,7,Fmotion to dismiss the murder case
OL,8,Fagainst Lindsay Clancy, the US woman
OL,9,Faccused of killing her three children.
OL,11,FThe judge's ruling follows her defence
OL,12,Fteam's request to dismiss the case
OL,13,Fafter the 12-person jury in her
OL,14,FSeptember trial failed to reach a
OL,15,Fverdict.
OL,17,FClancy has not denied killing her
OL,18,Fchildren in 2023, but her defence team
OL,19,Fargues she was suffering from severe
OL,20,Fpostpartum psychosis at the time.
OL,21,FProsecutors say the killings were
OL,22,Fintentional.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
