OL,3,AJudge denies motion to dismiss Lindsay
OL,4,AClancy's murder case
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ruling clears the way for
OL,7,Fprosecutors to pursue the case. They
OL,8,Fcould reduce the charges in a potential
OL,9,Fsecond trial or dismiss them
OL,10,Faltogether.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
